{"id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-partially-conservative.md","title":"Gamma Consequences and Conservative Extensions","display":"df-partially-conservative — Gamma Consequences and Conservative Extensions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-partially-conservative","aliases":["67-df-partially-conservative"],"display":"df-partially-conservative — Gamma Consequences and Conservative Extensions","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]","[[67-df-prim-theory]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":5,"source_label":"Gamma-conservative sentence; Gamma-subtheory; conservative extension","source_printed_pages":"62–63,66","source_pdf_pages":"73–74,77","source_proof_status":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-partially-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-partially-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partially-conservative — Gamma Consequences and Conservative Extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d91538d9e6829fd1\" href=\"?note=d91538d9e6829fd1\" title=\"67-df-prim-theory\">67-df-prim-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Gamma-conservative sentence; Gamma-subtheory; conservative extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"62–63,66"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"73–74,77"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\theta\">\\(S\\vdash\\theta\\)</span> 是元语言可推导性（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>），不把公理集与其定理集认同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\)</span> 在下式定义。扩张通过可证明每个原公理表达，允许不同呈示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\theta\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\chi\\in T\\ S\\vdash\\chi\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\theta\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\chi\\in T\\ S\\vdash\\chi\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>方向固定为强理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 对弱理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 不增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 后果。原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash_\\Gamma T\">\\(S\\vdash_\\Gamma T\\)</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)\\)</span>。句子保守性在第 62 页定义，保守扩张在第 66 页定义。</p>\n<p>旧稿强制原公理集字面包含于新公理集，会妨碍书中“用一个句子压缩可枚举公理集”的定理；新稿使用演绎扩张，既不要求公理集封闭，也不把不同呈示误判为无扩张关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq S\">\\(T\\subseteq S\\)</span> 是充分条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\vdash\\theta$ 是元语言可推导性（[[67-df-prim-provability]]），不把公理集与其定理集认同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\theta\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(S,T)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\chi\\in T\\ S\\vdash\\chi\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{Conserv}_\\Gamma(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\},T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash_\\Gamma T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_\\Gamma(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq S","display":false}],"bytes":2196,"backlinks":[{"id":"c79b9c68c2400931","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_n^T$ 是 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的精确相对公式类，$\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Pi_n}$ 采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]。"},{"id":"fbd3170495a52979","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 采用 [[67-df-recursively-enumera